+```
+ts	host	device	size_kb	used_kb	avail_kb	used_pct	inode_pct	mem_current	mem_max	town_kb	state_kb	seats_kb	level
+2026-10-14T16:32:33Z	marceline-dev	/dev/mapper/myluks1	2205156440	928095904	1154923456	45		32210964480	32212254720	868	0	0	ok
+```
+
+**Controlled reclamation** — 12 MB of aged, office-owned junk was created, then reclaimed:
